---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Dr. Sajjad Yousafzai"
  description="Read the terms of service for drsajjadyousafzai.com, including website use, appointment requests, and medical information disclaimers."
  path="/terms-of-service"
>
  <section class="section legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-shell">
      <header class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal information</p>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-card reveal" data-delay="80">
        <p>
          By using this website, you agree to these terms and conditions. This website is intended to provide general
          information about Dr. Sajjad Yousafzai, clinic services, contact details, and appointment arrangements.
        </p>

        <h2>General information only</h2>
        <p>
          The content on this website is for informational purposes only and does not constitute medical advice,
          diagnosis, or treatment. It is not a substitute for a proper clinical examination or professional judgement.
          Patients must seek direct medical attention when needed and should not delay urgent care.
        </p>

        <h2>Appointments and enquiries</h2>
        <p>
          Appointment requests submitted via the website or WhatsApp are not a guarantee of treatment or clinical review.
          The clinic may contact you to confirm availability, eligibility, or relevant details. Final treatment decisions
          remain the responsibility of the attending medical team.
        </p>

        <h2>Website usage</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to use this site responsibly and not to misuse contact forms, impersonate others, or send abusive,
          inappropriate, or unlawful content. We reserve the right to restrict or refuse access where necessary.
        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2>
        <p>
          While every effort is made to keep information current and accurate, the clinic does not guarantee that the
          website is complete, error-free, or continuously available. Service details, timings, locations, and fees may
          change with notice.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Content on this website, including text, images, branding, and design elements, is protected by copyright and
          may not be reproduced without permission except for personal or informational use.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          The clinic and website operators do not accept responsibility for indirect, incidental, or consequential losses
          arising from the use of this website or reliance on any information provided here, except where required by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          The handling of personal information is governed by the website privacy policy. By using the site, you agree
          to the terms of that policy as it applies to enquiries and appointment arrangements.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>
          These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the website after changes are published means
          you accept the revised terms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-section {
    padding-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .legal-shell {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .legal-card > * + * {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 1.8vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .legal-card p,
  .legal-card li {
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
</style>
